{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35436","headline":"送刘尊师祗诏阙庭三首 二 · 曹唐","name":"送刘尊师祗诏阙庭三首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"五峰已别隔人间，双阙何年许再还。\n既埽山川收地脉，须留日月驻天颜。\n霞觞共饮身虽在，风驭难陪迹未闲。\n从此枕中唯有梦，梦魂何处访三山。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"曹唐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_35436.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35436","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}